+# Charts 1.0 website handoff
+
+These changes are staged only, do not deploy before the 1.0 npm packages and
+release tag are verified. The announcement is a draft and its publication date
+must be set to the actual launch date before removing `draft: true`.
+
+- Remove the Charts alpha badge and select v1 in the library registry.
+- Link the stable compatibility contract and migration guide from the landing page.
+- Keep React Native explicitly experimental.
+- Correct the current compact-scale React line claim to 32.1 decimal gzip kB.
+  The measurement is 32.091 kB, esbuild 0.27.7, Node 24.18.0, production ESM
+  browser build, with React external. It is not an application's total size.
+- Keep the existing multi-library graphic labeled as an August 2026 snapshot,
+  do not present its 29 kB Charts value as a measurement of 1.0.
+- Update the website's locked Charts dependency from 0.16.1 to the published
+  1.0 release, regenerate landing SVGs through the existing generator, and
+  validate interactive demos against that dependency before deployment.
+- Verify latest/v1 docs routes, compatibility and migration links, framework
+  picker, readme image, page metadata, mobile layout, and keyboard interaction.
+- Decide how to preserve historical v0 docs before exposing v0 in the version
+  selector. The current site resolves non-latest versions directly as Git refs,
+  so adding v0 without an actual v0 ref would produce broken documentation.
+
+The source site checkout has unrelated uncommitted work, none of it was copied
+into this isolated HEAD snapshot or modified. No changes are deployed.
